|| {candrāvalokanam} ||

hariḥ oṃ ||

maheśvara uvāca(-)

antarlakṣyaṃ tvahirdṛṣṭirnimeṣonmeṣa varjitam |
iyaṃ sā śāmbhavī mudrā sarvanteṣu gopitā || 1 ||

antarlakṣya vilīna cittapavano yogī yadā vartate |
dṛṣṭyā niścala(tara)yā bahirathaḥ paśyanna payet sadā |

mudreyaṃ khalu khecarī bhavati sā yuktā prasādādguroḥ |
śūnyāśūnya vivarjitaṃ sphurati cet tatvaṃ padaṃ śāmbhavam ||

ardhodghaṭitalocana sthiramanā nāsāgra datte kṣaṇaḥ 
candrārkāvapi līnatāmupagatau niṣpandarūpaṃ vapuḥ |
jyotīrūpamaśeṣabāhyarahitaṃ dedīpyamānaṃ paraṃ 
tatvaṃ tat padameti yat tu paramaṃ vācyaṃ kimātrādhikam ||

yasmillaye'ti garbhasye'ntentarlaya vedite |
layaḥ so'pi ca vijñeyastuṣṭena guruṇā yutaḥ ||

yā citissarvabhūtānām udayavyayasākṣiṇī |
tāṃ citiṃ paśya kāyasyāṃ pūrṇānandaghanāmṛtām ||

śivo'nyatramano'nyatra śaktiranyatramārutaḥ |
na siddhyati varārohe kalpakoṭiśatairapi ||

jñānaṃ kuto manasi jīvati devi yāvat
prāṇe'pi jīvati mano mriyatena yāvat |

<p. 2>

prāṇo mano dvayamidaṃ vilayaṃ prayāti
mokṣaṃ sa gacchati naro na kathañcidanyaḥ ||

sayogeṣu viyogeṣu aṇubīja sukhādikam |
yaḥ kuryād dṛṣṭi liṅgeṣu nā sāvadhānonirantaram ||

yatra dṛṣṭirmanastatra bhūtendriya sanātanam |
sā śaktissa hi bhūtānāṃ dṛṣṭirlakṣye layaṃgatā ||

yatra dṛṣṭirmanaḥsyairyaṃ tatra caiva hi mārutaḥ |
ayaṃ kopi bhavedevaṃ tasyāragai siddhasammataḥ ||

cakṣuragrasthito kāraṃ sabāhyābhyantara sthitam |
dṛśyate cakṣuragre'pi cakṣuvaiva na paśyati ||

cakṣuragra sthito nityaṃ visphuranyomaṇiryathā |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā vyāpakaṃ śambhuṃ bhavabandhaiḥ pramucyate ||

ātma jyotirmano jyotirjyotiścakṣurna paśyati |
sābāhyābhyantaraṃ jyotiḥ sa jyotiśśivaḥ ucyate ||

yāvannaiva praviśati caranmāruto madhyamārge
yāvadbindurna bhavati dṛḍhaḥ prāṇavāta prabuddhaḥ |
yāvadvo (* * *) sadṛśa sarasaṃ jāyate nonmanatvaṃ
tāvatsarvaṃ yadi ca vadate dambhamithyā pralāpaḥ ||

nityābhyāsarataḥ kāścid gurubhaktaśca niścalaḥ |
sahajaṃ yo na jānāti andhavatsa pravartate ||

amāvāsyā ca pratipat paurṇamāsī ca gopyate |
kāmaṃ viṣaṃ nirañjānāt (* * * *) sarvatra pariveśitā ||

agre prema yutā pālyā lokānāṃ bhramaṇāyate |
yathā bhūtaṃ na jānaṃti mithyādambheṇa daṃbhitāḥ ||

<p. 3>

amāvāsyā ca pratipat paurṇamāsī ca gopyate |
kāmaṃ viṣaṃ nirañjanaṃ sarvasyo parisaṃsthitam ||

matsyendra uvāca(-)

amāvāsyā ca pratipat paurṇamāsī ca śaṅkara |
kathaṃ sā bhaṇyate saṃjñā sarvaṃ vyākhyā hi tatvataḥ ||

īśvara uvāca(-)

pratipaccakṣurunmeṣa amāvāsyāstalocanā |
ardhāvalokanaṃ yāvat parṇamāsīṃ vadantitām ||

matsyendraḥ(-)

kāma śabdena kiṃ vācyaṃ viṣeṇāpi kimucyate |
nirañjanasvabhāvaḥ kaḥ etadākhyā hi tatvataḥ ||

īśvaraḥ(-)

pratipadgrasate kālaṃ mamāvāsyā tathaiva ca |
pa (* * *) sthirīkṛtya panthā bhavati nānyathā ||

kāmena viṣayākāṅkṣā viṣāt kāmasya tallayaḥ |
dvāvetau santyajennityaṃ nirañjanamupāśrayet ||
aparaḥ santyajetsarvaṃ yadīcchedātmanohitam ||

anyathāmaraṇañcaiva bhuktatvāt (* * *) ni ca |
śakti madhye manaḥ kṛtvā manaḥ śaktestu madhyagam |

manasā mana ālokya taddhyāyet paramaṃ padam ||

matsyendraḥ(-)


bījaḥ caiva kimākhyātaṃ kīdṛśaṃ bindulakṣaṇam |
kathañcotpadyate binduretadākhyāhi tatvataḥ ||

īśvaraḥ(-)

mana eva hi bījaścotpatti sthiti kāraṇam |
manasotpadyate binduryathā kṣīraṃ ghṛtātmakam ||

matsyendraḥ(-)

śikhā nagāgra paryantaṃ vyāpitañca sukhāsukham |
dravate ghaṇṭikācchidraṃ bandhanaṃ tasya kīdṛśam ||

īśvaraḥ(-)

na ca bandhanamadhyasthaṃ na caikaraṇamānasam |

<p. 4>

candrāt madhya śaktiryatra syā tatra bandhanam |
jñātvā suṣumnā sadbhedaṃ kṛtvā vāmuñca madhyagam ||

kṛtvā sā vaindave sthāne ghrāṇarandhre nirodhayet |

matsyendraḥ(-)

vāsubinduḥ samākhyātaḥ tatvaṃ prakṛtimeva ca ||

ṣaṭcakrāṇi na jānāmi kathayasva prasīdame |
  

īśvaraḥ(-)

ādhārañca svādhiṣṭhānaṃ maṇipūraṃ tṛtīyakam ||

anāhataṃ viśuddhañcājñācakraṃ ca ṣaṣṭhakam |
athāraṃ gudamityuktaṃ svādhiṣṭhāñca liṅgakam ||

maṇipūraṃ nābhideśe hṛdayasthamanāhatam |
viśuddhaṃ kaṇṭhadeśe cājñācakraṃ ca mastake ||

ṣaṭcakrāṇi parijñāya praviśed dhruvamaṇḍale |
praviśedvāyumākṛṣya tathairvordhve niyojayet ||

evaṃ samabhyasettāvadyo brahmāṇḍamayo bhavet |
vāyurbindustathā cakraṃ citte citte yuktaṃ samabhyaset ||

samādhinaikena samaṃmamṛtaṃ yānti yoginaḥ |
yathāgnirdāru madhyastho vottiṣṭhenmathane vinā ||

tathaivābhyāsa yogena jñānadīptirna caiva hi |
ghaṭamadhye yathā dīpo bāhye naiva prakāśayet ||

(* * *) smin gate caiva dīpajvālāvabhāsate |
svabhāvaṃ ghaṭamityuktaṃ dīpameva hi tatpadam |
guruvākyā (* * *) nna brahma jñānaṃ sphuṭī bhavet ||

karṇadhāraṃ guruṃ prāpya kṛtvā sūkṣmāntarāṇi ca |
abhyāsa vāhanā saktāstaranti bhavasāgaram ||

matsyendra uvāca(-)

tavapāda prasādena mukto'haṃ bhavabandhanāt |
tvaṃ gatirdeva deveśa nānyathā me'stiśaṅkara ||

śrutvāmatsendra vāktyantu praviṣṭo bhagavān śivaḥ |
gaccha putra pṛthivyāṃtvaṃ trailokyaṃ coddhariṣyasi ||

[iti maheśvareṇaviracitaṃ candrāvalokanam sampūrṇaṃ] ||

|| śrīgurunāthāya namaḥ ||






